  (text "Safety inputs: 2 e-stops + 2 lidars, 24 V through PC817 - shield for Arduino UNO R4 WiFi / UNO Q" (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dc909a62-8bca-5869-b362-039a4ea99ce8))
  (text "E-stop loops: 3.3 k -> 6.3 mA (0.20 W at 28.8 V).  Lidar inputs: 4.7 k -> 4.4 mA (0.14 W).  R1-R4 are 1/2 W (body 9 x 3.2 mm); pull-ups 1/4 W." (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c7423797-d3d5-5406-8574-9fcb14722b05))
  (text "C1-C4 are OPTIONAL: fitted, an opening shorter than about 1.5 ms is not seen by the Arduino, and every stop is seen about 1.6 ms later." (at 25.4 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 573fa314-4f18-53e2-8bac-3fb42e4b9944))
  (text "No current (button pressed, zone occupied, wire cut, 24 V lost) -> pin HIGH = STOP.  F1 protects the 24 V wires going out to the buttons." (at 25.4 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d3537b22-1464-50cd-af5e-79ab64d2dfa8))
  (text "GND_24V and GND are NOT connected: this is the isolation barrier.  Pull-ups go to IOREF (5 V on UNO R4 WiFi, 3.3 V on UNO Q), never to 5V." (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 07ceef8a-136a-50c3-9b81-4bac26bcfdcb))
  (text "ISOLATION" (at 113.03 173.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 75bd39cd-832b-573d-858d-4c162a6ae0c5))
